graph LR
    Operator["llm-d-batch-gateway-operator"]

    %% Platform Dependencies (CRD CRUD + conditional watch)
    Operator -->|CRD CRUD<br/>Certificate CRs| CertManager["cert-manager<br/>v1.20.2"]
    Operator -->|CRD CRUD +<br/>conditional watch<br/>HTTPRoutes| GatewayAPI["Gateway API<br/>v1.5.1"]
    Operator -->|CRD CRUD +<br/>conditional watch<br/>ServiceMonitors,<br/>PodMonitors,<br/>PrometheusRules| PromOp["prometheus-operator<br/>v0.91.0"]

    %% Core Framework Dependencies
    Operator -->|operator framework| ControllerRuntime["controller-runtime<br/>v0.23.3"]
    Operator -->|chart rendering| Helm["helm.sh/helm/v3<br/>v3.20.2"]

    %% Kubernetes API Dependencies
    Operator -->|resource operations<br/>6443/HTTPS| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>k8s.io/api v0.35.2"]

    %% Managed Workloads (deployed by operator)
    Operator ==>|deploys| APIServer["API Server<br/>$APISERVER_IMAGE"]
    Operator ==>|deploys| Processor["Request Processor<br/>$PROCESSOR_IMAGE"]
    Operator ==>|deploys| GC["Garbage Collector<br/>$GC_IMAGE"]
    Operator ==>|deploys<br/>conditional| AsyncProc["Async Processor<br/>$ASYNC_IMAGE"]

    %% Managed workload downstream dependencies
    APIServer -->|batch state| Database["PostgreSQL /<br/>Redis / Valkey"]
    Processor -->|sync: HTTP<br/>async: Redis| InferenceGW["Inference<br/>Gateway"]
    GC -->|file cleanup| Storage["S3 / PVC"]
    AsyncProc -->|Redis queue<br/>dispatch via EPP| InferenceGW

    %% Observability
    Operator -.->|metrics| Prometheus["Prometheus<br/>(via prometheus-operator)"]

    %% Styling
    style Operator fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff
    style CertManager fill:#d79b00,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style GatewayAPI fill:#d79b00,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style PromOp fill:#d79b00,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ControllerRuntime fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Helm fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style K8sAPI fill:#326ce5,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style APIServer fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Processor fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style GC fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style AsyncProc fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Database fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style InferenceGW fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Storage fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
